/**
 * @defgroup EzCore EzCore - Foundational Utilities & Math
 * @brief Core diagnostic reporting, arbitrary-precision arithmetic, source tracking, and intrusive containers.
 *
 * The EzCore subsystem provides foundational services shared across the compiler toolchain:
 * - Diagnostic management with scope backtracking (Commit, Discard, Propagate).
 * - Arbitrary-precision integer math (`FlexInt`) backed by LibTomMath.
 * - Arbitrary-precision IEEE-754 floating-point math (`FlexFloat`) backed by LibBF.
 * - Source location management with binary-searched line and column lookup (`SourceManager`).
 * - High-speed utility data structures (`DenseBitSet`, `IntrusiveLinkedList`, `NameRegistry`).
 */

/**
 * @defgroup EzMir EzMir - Machine Intermediate Representation & SSA
 * @brief Multi-tier intermediate representation, SSA transformations, dataflow analysis, and textual syntax.
 *
 * The EzMir subsystem implements a strongly-typed, three-tier intermediate representation:
 * - High-Level IR: Target-independent SSA operations.
 * - Pass-Internal IR: Lowering primitives for calling conventions and stack adjustments.
 * - Target-Low IR: Physical-register bound target instructions.
 * Includes Cytron SSA phi construction, Cooper-Harvey-Kennedy dominator tree computation,
 * liveness analysis bitvectors, and textual MIR serialization/deserialization.
 */

/**
 * @defgroup EzDsl EzDsl - Declarative Architecture DSL & Generators
 * @brief Domain-specific languages, lexing, semantic analysis, and C++ code generator backends.
 *
 * The EzDsl subsystem provides 9 declarative languages for modeling CPU architectures:
 * - Lexy zero-copy parser combinators.
 * - Multi-pass semantic validation (Sema) and symbol tables.
 * - 10 C++ code generators producing instruction tables, selectors, register banks, and ABIs.
 */

/**
 * @defgroup EzCodeEmitter EzCodeEmitter - Binary Section & Object Emitter
 * @brief Doubly-linked node section streams, machine code serialization, relocations, and ELF/COFF writers.
 *
 * The EzCodeEmitter subsystem provides linear code streaming and binary object packaging:
 * - Doubly-linked section stream (`DataNode`, `LabelNode`, `AlignNode`).
 * - Section offset finalization and binary relocation patching.
 * - Native 64-bit ELF (`Elf64Writer`) and Windows COFF (`CoffWriter`) object file generation.
 */

/**
 * @defgroup EzTriple EzTriple - Target Architecture & Environment Triples
 * @brief Normalized target triple parsing, platform identification, and ABI selection.
 *
 * The EzTriple subsystem parses, canonicalizes, and queries target architecture strings
 * (e.g. `x86_64-pc-windows-msvc`, `x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu`) to select ABIs and object formats.
 */

/**
 * @defgroup EzCompiler EzCompiler - Pipeline Driver & Engine
 * @brief Compiler driver, pass scheduling, target resolver registry, and end-to-end compilation pipeline.
 *
 * The EzCompiler subsystem coordinates the compilation session:
 * - Standalone executable driver `ezc` and library `EzCompilerLib`.
 * - Central architecture factory registry (`TargetResolver`).
 * - Multi-phase compilation pipeline: Middle-End -> Legalization -> Instruction Selection -> ABI/Frame Lowering -> Register Allocation -> Emission.
 */

/**
 * @defgroup EzTargets EzTargets - Architecture Implementations
 * @brief Concrete target architecture descriptors, frame lowerers, instruction selectors, and binary emitters.
 *
 * The EzTargets subsystem houses hardware architecture implementations:
 * - Reference `x86_64` backend with System V AMD64 and Windows x64 ABIs.
 * - Frame lowering, stack alignment, callee-saved register preservation.
 * - Tree-pattern instruction selection with custom fallback handlers.
 * - Machine instruction encoding and relocation resolving.
 */
